      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": [
        {
          "NlmCategory": "BACKGROUND",
          "Label": "INTRODUCTION",
          "content": "The Importance of the cardiovascular effects, fundamentally the ventricular arrhythmias, produced by the antipsychotic ones, is discussed."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "METHODS",
          "Label": "CLINICAL CASE",
          "content": "28 year old patient with morbid obesity, operated by bariatric surgery, with good result, suffers a ventricular no supported polymorphic tachycardia while he was heightening treatment with aripiprazole and fluoxetine."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "Label": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "content": "To value the influence of diverse factors for the production of ventricular arrhythmias emphasizing fundamentally the interactions of aripiprazole and the loss of weight."
        }
      ]},
